# symbolic SATO template
# family: Standard Retail (customer H/L/B/D/F) / 4x3
# ported from c:\Workspace\southalr\dtlbl060b.i (LblSz="4x3" branch) — identical to the
# 4.5x3 variant of this same legacy file except the right-edge side panel (brand/CPN/
# icon stack) is always suppressed regardless of PanelType (see ApplyRetail4x3, which
# forces SidePanelBlock empty). Case barcode, grade highlight, and qty/weight block are
# NOT suppressed on 4x3 — only the side panel is, per legacy's own gating.
#
# See lt_retail_45x3.sato for the full field-by-field notes; this file mirrors it.

